#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to primitives in Qiskit Runtime, and an explanation of "
"available primitives"
msgstr ""
"Introducere în primitivele din Qiskit Runtime și explicarea primitivelor "
"disponibile"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives"
msgstr "Introducere în primitive"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Introducere în primitive {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitivele au fost create pentru a simplifica cele mai frecvente sarcini "
"pentru calculatoarele cuantice: și anume, eșantionarea stărilor cuantice și "
"calcularea valorilor de așteptare. Primele primitive Qiskit Runtime "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) și "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) sunt implementări ale [claselor de bază pentru "
"primitive](/guides/primitives) din Qiskit. Ele oferă o implementare mai "
"sofisticată (de exemplu, prin includerea atenuării erorilor) ca serviciu "
"bazat pe cloud și sunt folosite pentru a accesa hardware IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cea mai nouă primitivă Qiskit Runtime, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(care este în versiune beta), oferă o interfață de nivel inferior ce oferă "
"mai multă vizibilitate și control fără a sacrifica performanța.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Calculează valorile de așteptare pentru unul sau mai mulți observabili față de stările pregătite de circuite cuantice. Are metode integrate de suprimare și atenuare a erorilor.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Start rapid cu Estimator\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Eșantionează registrul de ieșire din execuția unuia sau a mai multor circuite cuantice.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Start rapid cu Sampler\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Eșantionează registrele de ieșire din execuțiile circuitelor cuantice pe baza directivelor de intrare și îți oferă control total și transparență asupra personalizării metodelor de atenuare a erorilor.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Start rapid cu Executor\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Pașii următori {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomandări\">\n"
"- Află despre [primitivele Qiskit](/guides/primitives) pe care se bazează primitivele Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Consultă exemple detaliate pentru [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) sau [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Consultă detaliile de intrare și ieșire pentru [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) și [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Exersează cu primitivele parcurgând [lecția despre funcțiile de cost](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) din IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Consultă [referința API EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [referința API SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) și [referința API Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Citește [Migrare la primitive V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
